      "verified_by": "A-ROOT-MISSING-STR-INITIALIZATION",
      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "The CHOICE-name buffer `str` is a fixed uninitialized stack array. After the malformed witness makes libtasn1 select `DirectoryString.ia5String`, `decode_complex_string` lets `asn1_read_value(..., \"\", str, &len)` write only `ia5String\\0` and then adds `str[len] = 0`, but it still dispatches on `str` with `strcmp` as if the whole buffer were defined."
    },
