      "fine_trace_step": 8,
      "description": "MSAN crash site. The first CHOICE-name dispatch compares `str`, whose defined prefix is only `ia5String\\0\\0`, against the literal `\"teletexString\"`, and the compare consumes uninitialized bytes from the untouched tail of `str`."
